 "grading": "With the published appendix-A3 combination counts, 600-1200x has 127.6 combinations/race and 1200-2500x 194.4. 600-1200x clears the best-band Bonferroni threshold only with design effect 1.0 (needed 105.8 at k=15, fewer at k=9) and fails at 1.5-2.0; 1200-2500x fails even at 1.0 (needed 265.4 at k=15). Both point estimates stay below break-even. The claim remains a single-period (2025-2026), terminal-price, post-hoc band selection that EXP21 cannot replicate (no trifecta price source passes G0)."
}